*
!.gitignore

# Platform content symlinked from this repo's own rules/ directory
# (harmonic-forge#542). Ignored rather than tracked: a relative link resolves
# inside whichever WORKTREE holds it, while sync_rules.py anchors its expected
# target to PLATFORM_ROOT, so a tracked relative link makes --verify report
# nine false [BROKEN] lines in each of the four forge worktrees and makes
# --project relink them to absolute paths. Measured, not assumed.
#
# The links are created by .githooks/post-checkout / post-merge, exactly as in
# every consuming repo. The platform is not exempt from its own mechanism.
